13 Into temptation lead us not.
But us from every evil save;
For thine the universal reign,
The pow'r and glory always was,
Is, and shall ever be: AMEN.

O Thou who art both wise and good,
We trust thee for our daily food,
And what thou seest is best;
Our foolish wishes, Lord, deny,
